        "desc": "스크립트가 실행(평가)되기 전에 소스가 바뀌어 실행 결과가 달라지는지 확인 (isTestText → isChangeText)",
        "scriptlet": "trusted-replace-node-text",
        "scriptletParams": ["SCRIPT", "isTestText", "isChangeText"],
        "target": "<div class='target'><script>window.rpnt_4=null;delete window.isTestText;delete window.isChangeText;(function(){const container=document.currentScript.parentElement;const el=document.createElement('script');el.type='application/json';el.textContent='window.isTestText = \"tester\";';container.appendChild(el);setTimeout(function(){try{Function(el.textContent)();}catch(e){}const ok=(window.isTestText===undefined)&&(window.isChangeText===\"tester\");window.rpnt_4=ok?\"ok\":\"fail\";},200);}())</script>Script 평가 결과: <span class='status'>대기중</span><br></div>",
        "verification": "textEquals:window.rpnt_4:ok"
